{"product_id":"gravity","title":"Gravity Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eGravity Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of unparalleled audio quality with Gravity, the ultimate earbuds designed for those who demand the best in sound and style. Perfect for any lifestyle, these \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbuds \u003c\/a\u003ekeep you connected, deliver crystal-clear audio, and enhance your daily activities with ease..\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Gravity Earbuds:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGravity is equipped with state-of-the-art features to elevate your listening experience. Enjoy high-definition sound with deep bass and clear treble, ensuring an immersive audio experience. The noise isolation technology minimizes background noise, allowing you to focus on your music or calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with intuitive touch controls for easy management of calls, music, and voice assistants. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout the day, and the ergonomic design provides a secure and comfortable fit. The sweat and water-resistant build make it perfect for workouts and outdoor activities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Gravity Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDriver Size: 12mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 6 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise isolation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 4g per earbud, 45g charging case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case: 350mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Gravity Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing Gravity means opting for a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and stylish design. Its high-definition sound, smart touch controls, and ergonomic fit make it a standout choice. The robust build and advanced features ensure it meets the demands of any lifestyle. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a smooth experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":48634514637078,"sku":"20382","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Soft Lilac","offer_id":48634514506006,"sku":"20494","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50374501433622,"sku":"22832","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl Pink","offer_id":48634514538774,"sku":"20498","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ice Blue","offer_id":48634514604310,"sku":"20496","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":48634514571542,"sku":"20492","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_b33187c4-bd27-4682-9fdf-0bd11c597370.webp?v=1785850205","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/gravity","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}